{"date":"2018-03-23","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/64/cc/225561_14L6A.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/64/cc/225561_14L6A.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/64/cc/225561_14L6A.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/64/cc/225561_14L6A.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/64/cc/225561_14L6A.jpg"},"summary":"　　故事发生在未来的时空之中，犬流感的肆虐让市长（野村训市 配音）颁布的狗狗流放法案，将城市里的所有犬类都投放到了“垃圾岛”之上，任它们自生自灭，市长家的护卫犬点点（列维·施瑞博尔 Liev Schreiber 饰）首当其冲。就这样，本来被养在家中锦衣玉食的狗狗们，都成为了要在垃圾堆里找吃食的流浪狗。\r\n　　首领（布莱恩·科兰斯顿 Bryan Cranston 配音）、君主（爱德华·诺顿 Edward Norton 配音）、老板（比尔·默瑞 Bill Murray 配音）、公爵（杰夫·高布伦 Jeff Goldblum 配音）和国王（鲍勃·巴拉班 Bob Balaban 配音）是岛上的五只流浪狗，它们通常结伴行动。一天，市长的养子阿塔里（科宇·兰金 Koyu Rankin 配音）忽然驾驶着飞机降落在了岛上，他要在这里寻找他一生的挚友点点。","name":"Isle of Dogs","name_cn":"犬之岛","tags":[{"name":"定格动画","count":128,"total_count":3228},{"name":"剧场版","count":114,"total_count":726084},{"name":"2018","count":80,"total_count":78162},{"name":"美国","count":69,"total_count":27162},{"name":"欧美","count":64,"total_count":86911},{"name":"韦斯安德森","count":62,"total_count":114},{"name":"原创","count":52,"total_count":621831},{"name":"动画电影","count":43,"total_count":43920},{"name":"电影","count":39,"total_count":13593},{"name":"政治隐喻","count":26,"total_count":37},{"name":"2018年","count":25,"total_count":4488},{"name":"WesAnderson","count":17,"total_count":34},{"name":"3D","count":12,"total_count":51170},{"name":"定格","count":6,"total_count":148},{"name":"动画","count":5,"total_count":35753},{"name":"奇幻","count":4,"total_count":473257},{"name":"2018年3月","count":2,"total_count":1212},{"name":"剧场","count":2,"total_count":1901},{"name":"暗黑","count":2,"total_count":480},{"name":"2010s","count":2,"total_count":5578},{"name":"欧美动画","count":2,"total_count":1176},{"name":"科幻","count":2,"total_count":253540},{"name":"政治","count":2,"total_count":2345},{"name":"映画","count":2,"total_count":6311},{"name":"アニメ映画","count":1,"total_count":2861},{"name":"Wes_Anderson","count":